{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>From any wooden vessel.</b> And not every wooden vessel — to exclude that which is not moved in its entirety. Or a sack of woven thread and [not] rope and cords." "<b>Or sack.</b> Of woven thread and [not] rope and cords." "<b>In which work is done with them.</b> And not [vessels for] use as a covering, for nothing is done inside them." "<b>It shall be put in water.</b> All of it at once — just as the purification mentioned in connection with sunset is all at once, so too the purification mentioned here is all at once."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:30.322245410Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}